Package: naturetools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for COSEWIC Assessments Using NatureCounts Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Steffi", "LaZerte", email = "steffi@steffi.ca", role = "aut"),
    person("Denis", "Lepage", email = "dlepage@birdscanada.org", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Tools for calculating and plotting COSEWIC Index of Area of
    Occupancy (IAO) and Extent of Occurrence (EOO) ranges from data on plant
    and animal populations, such as those from NatureCounts, a service
    managed by Birds Canada.
